---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GhostWord from '../components/GhostWord.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — 刘启征"
  description="Digital Media Technology student in Suzhou — short films, game levels, VFX, and the account that publishes them."
>
  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <GhostWord text="About" />
    <h1 class="t-display">
      <span class="line-mask"><span style="--i:0">About—</span></span>
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="prose" data-reveal>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm 刘启征 (Lin), a Digital Media Technology student at Suzhou Chien-Shiung
        Institute of Technology. I make short films, build Wuxia levels in Unreal Engine
        5, and do 3D and VFX in Blender.
      </p>
      <p class="cn">
        我是刘启征，苏州健雄职业技术学院数字媒体技术专业。做短片、在虚幻 5 里搭武侠场景、
        用 Blender 做三维和特效。
      </p>

      <p>
        What I like is the part most people skip: blocking a shot, lighting a set, cutting
        to the beat, grading until the whole thing holds together. A frame is mostly a
        decision about what to leave out.
      </p>
      <p class="cn">
        我喜欢的是别人容易跳过的部分：摆机位、布光、按节拍剪、调色直到整段立住。
        一帧里头，大部分功夫是「决定留下什么、扔掉什么」。
      </p>

      <p>
        Right now three things run at once: a short film about 王阳明, a Wuxia action level
        in Unreal Engine 5, and an account where I publish whatever comes out. Finishing
        one thing at a time is the hard part.
      </p>

      <h3>What I work with</h3>
      <p>
        Unreal Engine 5 · Blender &amp; particle VFX · Premiere / DaVinci Resolve · Figma ·
        HTML / CSS / JS · ComfyUI · writing &amp; editing.
      </p>

      <h3>Now</h3>
      <p>
        Building one pipeline from first sketch to release, and writing down what breaks
        along the way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-aside" data-reveal style="--d:1">
      <div>
        <h4>Based in</h4>
        <p>苏州 Suzhou, China</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Studying</h4>
        <p>Digital Media Technology<br />Suzhou Chien-Shiung Institute of Technology</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Direction</h4>
        <p>AIGC · Game engine · VFX · Self-media</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Tools</h4>
        <p>UE5 · Blender · Premiere · Figma · ComfyUI</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Contact</h4>
        <p>
          <a class="link-u" href="mailto:Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com" data-cursor="hover"
            >Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Base>
